{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ability Effects API - Bearer Token Auth",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Game Ability & Effect system with Bearer token authentication.\n\n## Feature Overview\nThe Game Ability & Effect API provides a standardized, data-driven system for managing gameplay effects including:\n- Buffs / Debuffs\n- Damage-over-Time (DoT) / Heal-over-Time (HoT)\n- Shields & Stat Modifiers\n- Status Effects & Passive Effects\n\n## Authentication Strategy\n- **Type**: Bearer Token (RFC 6750)\n- **Token Format**: {base64url_payload}.{hex_signature}\n- **Header**: Authorization: Bearer {token}\n- **Required Fields**: uid, rid, app_id, server_id, ts\n- **Signature**: HMAC-SHA256 hex-encoded\n\n## Setup Instructions\n1. Import the environment file: `MasterConfig_Dev.postman_environment.json`\n2. Set your environment variables (app_id, secret, uid, etc.)\n3. The pre-request script will automatically generate and attach Bearer tokens to requests\n\n## API Endpoints\n- POST /api/v1/ability/effects - Create effect configuration\n- GET /api/v1/ability/effects - List effects (paginated, filterable)\n- GET /api/v1/ability/effects/:id - Get effect by ID\n- PUT /api/v1/ability/effects/:id - Update effect configuration\n- DELETE /api/v1/ability/effects/:id - Delete effect\n\n## Effect Categories\n- Buff, Debuff, DamageOverTime, HealOverTime, Shield, StatusEffect, NegativeEffect, Passive\n\n## Duration Policies\n- 0: Instant (applied once, no duration)\n- 1: Duration (active for fixed time)\n- 2: Persistent (active until removed)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "ability-team"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Global Pre-request Script for Bearer Token Authentication",
          "// Compatible with handleTokenAuth.verifyGameToken in auth.go",
          "// Token Format: {base64url_payload}.{hex_signature}",
          "",
          "function base64UrlEncode(wordArray) {",
          "    let base64 = CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(wordArray);",
          "    return base64",
          "        .replace(/\\+/g, '-')",
          "        .replace(/\\//g, '_')",
          "        .replace(/=/g, '');",
          "}",
          "",
          "function generateBearerToken() {",
          "    const appId = pm.environment.get('app_id');",
          "    const secret = pm.environment.get('secret');",
          "    const uid = pm.environment.get('uid') || 'test_user_001';",
          "    const rid = pm.environment.get('rid') || `req_${Date.now()}`;",
          "    const serverId = pm.environment.get('server_id') || 'server_01';",
          "    ",
          "    if (!appId || !secret) {",
          "        console.error('Missing required environment variables: app_id or secret');",
          "        return null;",
          "    }",
          "    ",
          "    const ts = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);",
          "    ",
          "    const payload = {",
          "        uid: uid,",
          "        rid: rid,",
          "        app_id: appId,",
          "        server_id: serverId,",
          "        ts: ts",
          "    };",
          "    ",
          "    const payloadJson = JSON.stringify(payload);",
          "    const payloadWordArray = CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(payloadJson);",
          "    const payloadBase64Url = base64UrlEncode(payloadWordArray);",
          "    const signatureHex = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(payloadJson, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "    const token = `${payloadBase64Url}.${signatureHex}`;",
          "    ",
          "    console.log('=== Bearer Token Generated ===');",
          "    console.log('Final Token:', token);",
          "    console.log('==============================');",
          "    ",
          "    return token;",
          "}",
          "",
          "const token = generateBearerToken();",
          "if (token) {",
          "    pm.environment.set('bearer_token', token);",
          "    console.log('Bearer token set successfully');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
